/strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>4. When will the Allahabad High Court Research Associate Examination be conducted?</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The examination will be conducted <strong data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"941\">08/08/2026 by the Allahabad High Court</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>5. What is the mode of the Allahabad High Court Research Associate Examination?</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The examination will be conducted in <strong data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1097\">Screening Test</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>6. How can I apply for Allahabad High Court Research Associate Recruitment 2026?</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_22154\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-22154\" style=\"width: 1461px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-22154\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201471%20962'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"Allahabad High Court Research Associates 2026\" width=\"1471\" height=\"962\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ahcreserachassociate2026.png 1471w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-con